===============================================================================
2. COMMON / UTILITY PROGRAMS
===============================================================================

FILE NAME       TYPE  DOMAIN    PURPOSE
--------------  ----  --------  ----------------------------------------
ABORTN.NSN      SUB   COMMON    Abnormal termination handler
LOGERR.NSN      SUB   COMMON    Error logging to ERROR-LOG (file 200)
AUDITN.NSN      SUB   COMMON    Audit trail writer to AUDIT-LOG (file 210)
SEQNON.NSN      SUB   COMMON    Sequence number generator (file 220)
DATEU.NSN       SUB   UTILITY   Date utilities (format, diff, validate)
VALU.NSN        SUB   UTILITY   Field validation (email, phone, zip, etc.)
FMTU.NSN        SUB   UTILITY   Format utilities (currency, masks, etc.)
MSGHU.NSN       SUB   UTILITY   Message handler (file 230)
LOCKN.NSN       SUB   UTILITY   Record locking manager (file 240)
CONFIGN.NSN     SUB   UTILITY   Configuration manager (file 250)

DEPENDENCY CHAIN:
  ABORTN -> LOGERR (logs before abort)
  LOGERR -> (writes to file 200)
  AUDITN -> (writes to file 210)
  SEQNON -> (reads/updates file 220)
  LOCKN  -> (reads/updates file 240)
  CONFIGN-> (reads file 250)
  MSGHU  -> (reads file 230)

