===============================================================================
12. BATCH PROCESSING
===============================================================================

FILE NAME       TYPE  PURPOSE                          CALLS
--------------  ----  -------------------------------  ------------------
EODORD.NSP      PGM   EOD order processing                ORDCANC,AUDITN
EODINV.NSP      PGM   EOD inventory processing            INVREL,INVREPL,
                                                          LOCKN
EODSALE.NSP     PGM   EOD sales summary generation        (none)
EODPAY.NSP      PGM   EOD payment processing              AUDITN
EODPROM.NSP     PGM   EOD promotion maintenance            AUDITN
EODRECON.NSP    PGM   Master reconciliation checks         AUDITN
EODRET.NSP      PGM   EOD return processing                AUDITN
EODSUPP.NSP     PGM   EOD supplier performance             AUDITN

BATCH EXECUTION ORDER (RECOMMENDED):
  1. EODORD   - Process stale orders first
  2. EODINV   - Expire reservations, trigger replenishment
  3. EODPAY   - Settle payments, expire auths
  4. EODPROM  - Activate/deactivate promotions
  5. EODRET   - Expire stale returns, auto-close
  6. EODSUPP  - Recalculate supplier ratings
  7. EODSALE  - Generate sales summary (read-only)
  8. EODRECON - Final reconciliation check (read-only)

