- Reports are read-only (no data modifications)
- All reports have safety counters to limit scan depth
- Reports do not call AUDITN (no audit trail for reads)

===============================================================================
14. END-TO-END PROCESS FLOWS
===============================================================================

ORDER-TO-CASH FLOW:
  CUSTENTR -> ORDENTR -> ORDVAL -> INVCHK -> INVRES
  -> ORDPRICE2 -> ORDCONF -> PAYAUTH -> ALLOCATE
  -> SHIPENTR -> SHIPUPD (delivered) -> order CMP

PROCURE-TO-PAY FLOW:
  POENTR -> POVAL (submit/approve) -> PORECV
  -> INVUPD (receipt) -> POCLOSE -> SUPPUPD (spend)

RETURN FLOW:
  RETENTR -> RETCHK -> RETVAL -> RETPOST (approve)
  -> RETPOST (receive) -> RETPOST (inspect)
  -> RETPOST (restock/damage) -> PAYREV (refund)
  -> RETCLOSE -> CUSTUPD (spend adjustment)

EOD BATCH FLOW:
  EODORD -> EODINV -> EODPAY -> EODPROM -> EODRET
  -> EODSUPP -> EODSALE -> EODRECON

